        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Buuneeda gamus Yeremiya gamusiischeesa saawa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu fuga hees sean bea lugweega, sea Yohanani orjeeda Gareya ea Asariya orjeeda Hoshaya, sea buuneesean ghang'eada gea manang'i ea gagul gea hees, ghapka ea gwaneekiit ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak geeyeesha sibaneeda siguura Yeremiya, “Geemuscheey mwasa musiischoodeanya, ak gimusiischooweasa aba heeda NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U aba badahuukaasa, aba boosteang'su seaniin (aba gideaba geapuudeasa fiisu ng'ay aba jeeda fuga saang'a aba gididaaktaneasa aba gheanyangaagu), ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak abeeda ghoahiimneasa NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U naweeda jea eayaada, ea gichea eesina.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha sibaneeda siguura Yeremiya saawa, “Naayiinyi gidoorgu; ng'ula, gaydamwaash NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANG'WA aba gidoogasayi, ak gida wassean rukunean NG'UTAMIIDA gaydarukuneegwa; manda gida jea dafunyaneegwa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeesha saawa Yeremiya, “Gidabal ghoah NG'UTAMIIDA muushoocheanda huumwa doabiiwaat aba badahuukaasa iimeesindani ng'asheega sean gida eeshiindaneey NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U, ajeakneey heedeanya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ada aamiy ghana ea muy, gajeesisiina mureeda ng'asheanda NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANYA was dea siicheakseey headaanyi, ak abeeda ghamiidu ng'asheega aba heedeanya iisisissi mureeda ng'asheanda NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANYA.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "NG'UTAMIIDA ghamwas mooshta Yeremiya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iing'ata eawooji damanamughuush ghwahidu ng'asheanda NG'UTAMIIDA heeda Yeremiya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaguursa Yohanani orjeeda Gareya sea shirikareeda hees sean bea lugweega mideayi sea niny, sea buuneesean ghang'eada gea manang'i ea ghoah gea hees, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gwayeesha saawa, “Asi gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA, was ASEETA Israeli, was dea oocheaksean headaanyi deasa gidoamwaashchi: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iijea oopiidana ng'eang'i, abeeda gaydadeaseegwa ak ea maydanyarjaneegwa, gaydang'aaptaneegwa ak ea maydaloataneegwa; aba gideaba neaduukuuni gidamuy ghayi easimaneegwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adoawali sugoocheanda Babeli, was dea oowalayi; adoawali niny, gwarugu NG'UTAMIIDA, aba gideaba aniini geendeayi sea agooga, ak gealealneegwa nea ghaaghuuheegwa aba geatindaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aniini gaydabwaydaneegwa, ak abeeda ghaabwaydaneegwa ak ghaanung' oopiidana jeeda ng'eanyiideang'wa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ama ooyeenyi, ‘Majeepiidana jeedeaba ng'eanyiini,’ nea goofooli ng'asheega NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANG'WA ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gooyeenyi, ‘Manda, gajeeweaya ng'eanyiida Misri, heeda majeedaaha ng'ucheeda, ghana heeda majeeyiinya ghuuta durumbeati, ghana ghwayeadeasa jih aba gasooda mukaate, ak gajeepiidana hoowa,’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "asi iinya ng'asheanda NG'UTAMIIDA, Ea boosteanga Yuda. Nih gwarugu NG'UTAMIIDA bea lugweega, was ASEETA Israeli: Iyookeali iheengeagwa beata Misri ak gooweayi ak goopiidi hoowa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abeeda ng'uta oawali gayghwanyasaneegwa jeeda ng'eanyiida Misri; sea geejeeda oawali gaygamaseawneegwa aba jeeda ng'eanyiida Misri; ak gajameewiisiina hoowa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea buuneesean ageal iheenga nyaawa beata Misri ak goobiida hoowa gaygameewa aba ng'uta, ea aba geejeeda, ea dawni; ak ea maygwanda boostaaneeda ghana dea jea ghaghuuha munyinda jea dayiin badahuuka nyaawa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aba gideaba gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA bea lugweega, was ASEETA Israeli: Gidaweesiinda nyarasteanyu badahuukeaba fugiga abiita Yerusalemuun, eara nyarasteanyu gaydeahiisa badahuukeagwa iyooweayi Misri. Abeeda gajahuuwa fuga jea eeng'eawi, ea gidanung' ghaham fih ng'eanyi, ea mooshteayda, ea baspaseega. Ak ea maygudu abiikta adaaha ng'eanyiini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA aba ng'asheegeagwa, Ea boosteanga Yuda, ‘Adooweayi ng'eanyiida Misri.’ Anala aba huumwa gideaba aniini naamiinyi gheang'deang'wa askweareani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba noosinyi ng'asheega milmilanda aba badahuukeagwa agooga aba gideaba noocheaktanean heeda NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANG'WA, nea gooyeenyi, ‘Musiischooweasa aba heeda NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANYA, ak gida wassean jea gwarugu NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANYA abeeda rukuneasa gajeesna.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak aniini ghaahiimneegwa ng'asheesu askweareani, ak agooga ea mooleeysiini iit ghuuta NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANG'WA aba ng'asheanda wassean ajeakneani heedeang'wa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi ghamneawa anala aba huumwa gajameewa aba ghuuta ng'uta, ea geejeeda, ea aba dawni aba heeda oogasayi aweayeena ak goopiidi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
